cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite the paper below."
title: "Anxiety Detection Using Speech Analysis"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation of the speech stream of a dual-stream anxiety
  detection model: a parallel CNN + BiLSTM-with-attention network over
  128-band log-mel spectrograms, trained on the RAVDESS Emotional Song Audio
  corpus, with an emotion-to-anxiety proxy mapping over the affective
  circumplex.
type: software
version: 1.0.0
license: CC-BY-NC-SA-4.0
